2 CONT Might be Dorothy Nicholson, chr 20 Dec 1840, Ambleside, daughter of Th
2 CONC omas Nichollson and Dorothy Fleming who were married on 3 Dec 1835 at
2 CONC Rydal, Westmoreland.  They also had a daughter,, Agnes, christened 1 O
2 CONC ct 1836 at Ambleside, who probably married ~John Shepherd in the 1841
2 CONC at Kendal.
2 CONT
2 CONT This Thomas could have been the son (chr 19 Sep 1813) of Joseph Nichol
2 CONC son and Agnes Coward who are known to be the grandparents of Dora.  Th
2 CONC ey were married on 27 Feb 1797 at Ambleside and Agnes was the daughter
2 CONC  of Cornelious Coward and was chr at Grasmere on 9 July 1780.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes and Joseph also had David (chr 31 Aug 1797),  Cornelious (chr 14
2 CONC  May 1804), Joseph (chr 4 Oct 1807) Hannah (born 1809), Margaret (1823
2 CONC -1905) who married John Freeman.
