1 ISDEAD Y
1 NOTE Called Old Granny here. Mostly anyway. Buried at Schnapper Rock Road c
2 CONC emetery on the North Shore. I remember her well.
2 CONT
2 CONT Perhaps one shouldn’t speak ill of the dead, but my memories aren’t al
2 CONC l that pleasant, to be honest. She hated my mother, and took it out on
2 CONC  us kids. One of my earliest memories was being given tiny, tiny dinne
2 CONC rs when we stayed with them in Auckland, such small dinners I was left
2 CONC  hungry. Just to get at Mum. Successfully, too, I think.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ah well. A subject best left alone, I think.
