1 NOTE [RBB]: m. Charlotte Tolming.
2 CONT Issue 6: Mary Rebecca Boileau ,Leah Boileau ,Charlotte Madelaine De Ca
2 CONC stelnau Boileau ,Sarah Ann Maria Alicia Boileau
2 CONT
2 CONT [BBB]: b at Calcutta, 23 Nov 1799.   Educ at Bury St Edmunds Grammar S
2 CONC chool;  St Paul's School Hammersmith, 1811-19, where he was 'Capitaneo
2 CONC ' (Captain of the School), for his last year;  then Trinity College Ca
2 CONC mbridge, (Campden Exhibitioner and Perry Exhibitioner), BA 1823, MA 18
2 CONC 26.  Barrister at Law; admitted Lincoln's Inn 1823, called to the Bar
2 CONC 1826;  practised at Warrington sand Compton, Lancs.   Liberal candidat
2 CONC e for Bury, 1832, but withdrew before the poll.   M 1835, Charlotte To
2 CONC lming, dau of Thomas Brittain, of Ulverstoke;  they had issue : Mary R
2 CONC ebecca, Leah, Charlotte Madeleine de Castelnau, Sarah Anne Maria Alici
2 CONC a.   He went to India in 1840, and practised in Madras.   He d at Egto
2 CONC n, 15 Jun 1863.
