2 CONC houses of Provence (as he puts it), but Gabrielle does not appear ther
2 CONC e. However, it is likely that she was related to Antoine de Villages,
2 CONC Baron de Fontarèches, (son of Pierre who married Madeleine Boucher in
2 CONC 1488) as he was the author of the Bernis branch, established in Langue
2 CONC doc. Note that Gabrielle was married in Bernis.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Reitwiesner, Gabrielle was the grand-daughter of Antoine.
2 CONC  I tend to trust Reitwiesner, and so I shall follow this.
