1 NOTE Married Robert Mascall, of Peasmarsh Place and Ashford, in 1790. On 29
2 CONC th June, 1821, their daughter, Caroline Sarah Mascall, married her cou
2 CONC sin, Herbert Barrett Curteis. The same year that Caroline Eleanor Curt
2 CONC eis (sister of Herbert Barrett) married John Graham.
2 CONT
