1 NOTE Mabile Adhémar de Monteil.
2 CONT [C-D, XIV, 184] gives some information on the Monteil family.
2 CONT This Mabile is in [ES, XIV, 2], not Tafel 1. Tafel 1 seems to give a d
2 CONC ifferent Mabile, who marries a man with the same name, just on a diffe
2 CONC rent date. I suspect that [ES] is confused. [FM, 651] has only the one
2 CONC  Mabile, clearly the same as in [ES, XIV, 2], who marries the Simiane
2 CONC not Hugues Adhemar.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Rietstap (as I interpret it) Adhemar, comtesse de Grignan
2 CONC  (Prov) had the Adhemar arms quartered with the Castellane arms.
2 CONT Arms: Ec: aux 1 et 4 d’or à trois bandes d’azur (Adhémar); aux 2 et 3
2 CONC de gu. au château d’or, sommé de trois tours de même (Castellane).
