2 CONC there is an entry signed 'Chas. Boileau' stating that a very full acco
2 CONC unt of the family, written in his father's hand, was partly burnt in t
2 CONC he fire which followed the earthquake.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was appointed a Director of the French Hospital, London in 1768, an
2 CONC d d unmarried in London 1772.”
