1 NOTE [Lart, II, 13]
2 CONT [BBB]: Dau of George Wilson, of Dublin, a merchant (druggist).  Her po
2 CONC rtrait, by Dame-Darquier is now with John Theophilus viii Boileau.   T
2 CONC hey had 15 children : Mary Anne, Simeon iii, Magdalene, Ann-Charlotte
2 CONC ii, Jane i, John Peter iii, Elizabeth ii, George Wilson i, John Theoph
2 CONC ilus ii, Harriett, Jasper Desbrisay ii, Henrietta iii, Samuel Brandram
2 CONC  i, and Lestock Wilson.
2 CONT
2 CONT There appears to be no connection with Lestock Wilson, who married her
2 CONC  sister-in-law, Bonne, or Bonnie. Wilson is a fairly common name, I su
2 CONC ppose, so this isn’t unlikely. In addition, Bonne met Lestock Wilson o
2 CONC n board ship to India (he was the Captain), so one cannot argue from p
2 CONC roximity either.
