1 NOTE Only child. At least two of their children died young, as described in
2 CONC  the memorial plaque for her father, Richard, as described in his entr
2 CONC y. A plaque to her and and Hew is in the window of the same church (Ma
2 CONC ry Magdalen in Hayton).
2 CONT
2 CONT “To the memory of Field Marshal Sir Hew Dalrymple Ross G.C.B. born 5 J
2 CONC uly 1779 died 10 Dec 1868 buried in Brompton Cemetery and of his wife
2 CONC Elizabeth Margaret Graham of Stone House born 27 Aug 1792 died 5 Jan 1
2 CONC 878: buried in this Churchyard. ......”
2 CONT
2 CONT The plaque raised by her uncle James, says that she had five children,
2 CONC  and lists their details. (See the entry for her grandfather, Thomas G
2 CONC raham, where that plaque is reproduced).
