2 CONC  Officiers de la Couronne, p. 782. He was deprived of the Countship by
2 CONC  Pope Innocent III, who invested the Bishop of Maguelonne. The same Ra
2 CONC ymond Pelet paid homage for the lands of Alais on 19 July 1217, to Sim
2 CONC on, Count of Montfort, & to his son Amaury on 15 May 1220. He became s
2 CONC ick at Alais on 3 June 1227, and died the following year. His wife, Si
2 CONC bylle, was named in an act in 1227.
