2 CONC don en Gévaudan. His half-sister, Valborge, married into the de Tourne
2 CONC l family, hence the close connection between the Barons du Tournel and
2 CONC  the Châteauneuf lot. [CD] gives quite a different set of relationship
2 CONC s, giving Guerin completely different parents.
