2 CONC  witnesses in a transaction between the seigneurs of Simiane and the C
2 CONC ount of Forcalquier, in Nov. 1202. In 1220, he confirmed the rights of
2 CONC  pasturage of his mother, his uncle (Pierre, Comte de Die). The list g
2 CONC oes on in D’Hozier.
