2 CONC s established at Nimes before 1250. He acquired new fiefs by an act of
2 CONC  1286, was squire to King Philippe le Bet, and Chatelain of d’Aigues-M
2 CONC ortes, following some acts of 1294 and 1295, that proved he was the fa
