1 NOTE [BBB]: Educ at Cranbrook, Imperial Service College, Windsor and RMC Sa
2 CONC ndhurst 1916.  Regular Commission 2nd Lt Dorsetshire Regt July 1916;
2 CONC Lt Jan 1918.   War of 1914-18 : joined 1 Bn of the regt in France Nov
2 CONC 1917.    Comd of a representative party of the regt at an inspection b
2 CONC y King George V Aug 1918.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was killed in action 3rd Oct 1918.   His CO wrote of him that he wa
2 CONC s very willing and thoroughly reliable, and always carried out his dut
2 CONC ies bravely.   Another officer added that he was loved and esteemed, n
2 CONC ot only by his brother officers, but especially by the men of the HQ C
2 CONC oy he commanded.   BWM, VM.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was very musical, his special love being the church organ.
