2 CONC riage to the Ndeze princess was an arranged marriage between the two m
2 CONC ost important families of the Eastern Congo. They owned the land which
2 CONC  later became the Albert Park, now the Virunga [?, Ruwenzori?] Nationa
2 CONC l Park.
