1 NOTE of Ticeherst. Berry quotes the 1662 Visitation of Sussex for him. What
2 CONC  a name, Zabulon. The Newingtons certainly went in for strange puritan
2 CONC  names, if Berry is to be believed. We have a number of Zabulons, lots
2 CONC  of Samuels, a couple of Bathshuas, a Jabes, a Priscilla and a Nathani
2 CONC el. The Morgans, Dennis’s and Thomas’s look quite dull in comparison.
2 CONC Mind you, Zabulon’s wife wasn’t much better, having the somewhat flamb
2 CONC oyant name of Goodguift. They just don’t come like that any more. “Hi,
2 CONC  we’re your new neighbours, Zabulon and Goodguift. Have a scone.”
