2 CONT co-heiress of John Salerne, M.P., of Iden, Sussex.  High Sheriff of Ke
2 CONC nt, 3
2 CONT Nov. 1412 to 6 Nov. 1413 & from 13 Nov. 1423 to 6 Nov. 1424.  M.P. for
2 CONC  Kent
2 CONT 1416.  J.P. for Kent, 3 Feb. 1416 to July 1420 & from 12 Feb. 1422 to
2 CONC July
