1 NOTE Now this is a strange name. Very little digging shows it to be a form
2 CONC of Wauchope, an old Scottish name, which appeared first in Ireland in
2 CONC 1733. This variant of the name became well-known in India, an this Mat
2 CONC ilda is likely the sister of General Charles Wahab.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is an excellent writeup about the Wauchope family at http://home
2 CONC .att.net/~walkup/wauchope_ulster_book.pdf. I keep a copy on my compute
2 CONC r, just in case that link ever dies.
