1 NOTE She died ion 14 May, 1857 "at Kingston near Dublin Harriette Boileau t
2 CONC he beloved wife of Rev. F. A. Dawson rector of Buscot, Berks" (The Tim
2 CONC es l9 May, 1857)
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT Information from Gilian Iles:
2 CONT I have discovered the birth date of my cousins' ancestor Harriette (no
2 CONC  Anne) Boileau.  She was born on 29 May, l8O7 and baptised in Steyning
2 CONC , Sussex on l4 June, l807.  It would seem her 2 brothers Henry Conyngh
2 CONC am and Francis Burton (born l804 and 1806) were both baptised in Winch
2 CONC elsea, Sussex on 7 May, 1806.
2 CONT   You might also like to know that Harriette's other daughter Harriett
2 CONC a Baker Boileau Dawson who was born in India in 1845 married Revd. Ric
2 CONC hard Winstanley Allsopp in l873 and they had 10 children, one Jerome (
2 CONC born c1880) being given the second name Boileau.  Harrietta B.B. Allso
2 CONC pp died in 1918. I think I gave you the details of Harriette's other d
2 CONC aughter Mary Boileau Dawson - born Kent 1849, married John Rainforth W
2 CONC alker in 1880 and died in 1930.
2 CONT ------------------------
