2 BOUNDARYRECT -1006,316,-954,243
1 SEX M
1 NOTE District Judge at Benares.
2 CONT
2 CONT From the Oxford Dictionary of National Biography:
2 CONT
2 CONT Davis, Samuel (1760–1819), East India Company servant and orientalist,
2 CONC  was born in the West Indies, the younger son of John Davis, who held
2 CONC the post there of commissary-general, and his Welsh wife (née Phillips
2 CONC ). He went to England with his mother and two sisters after the death
2 CONC of his father. Despite the evident poverty of the family, Davis appear
2 CONC s to have received a good education, although the details are lost.
2 CONT
2 CONT It continues on.....
