1 NOTE From BBB:
2 CONT b in Dublin, 9 Nov 1781.   Cadet HEICS 1797.   Arrived in India Sept 1
2 CONC 798.   Cornet 3rd Native Cavalry, Nov 1798.   Lt 29 May 1800.  Took pa
2 CONC rt in ops in the Jumna Doab, Punjab, Dec 1802 - Mar 1803, dealing with
2 CONC  a minor rebellion.   2nd Mahratta War, 1803-06 : took part in the bat
2 CONC tles of Delhi, Laswari and Deig, all of which were hard-fought against
2 CONC  a strong enemy, and in the pursuit of Holkar, the Mahratta chief, to
2 CONC the Punjab.   Should have received the Inida Medal with three bars, bu
2 CONC t it was not issued until 1851.  Apart from the actual battles, the op
2 CONC s were of a leisurely character, with ooportunities for hunting and sh
2 CONC ooting, and dinner parties with plenty of wine.  He was appointed Adjt
2 CONC  & Paymr of the regt in 1805, holding the post until his death.   Prom
2 CONC oted Capt-Lt, Dec 1807.  d at Partabgarh, UP, 11 Apr, 1810.   Unmarrie
2 CONC d.
