1 NOTE from
2 CONT The Elliots: The Story of a Border Clan, a genealogical history. By Th
2 CONC e Dowager Lady Eliott of Stobs and Sir Arthur Eliott, 11th Baronet of
2 CONC Stobs. Published 1974. ISBN 0 85422 081 X.
2 CONT p174:
2 CONT "Indian Army. Drowned in Naini Tal Lake, North West Province, in 1856.
2 CONC "
2 CONT
2 CONT In Emily's Memoir, p5, it says:
2 CONT "My father's youngest brother 'George' (16) entered the Indian Army -
2 CONC and was drowned in the deep mountain Lake of Naini Tal when out shooti
2 CONC ng in 1850." This appears to be an error.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Rev. John Barton's Family Tree book, p9, it gives the dates here us
2 CONC ed, which agree with those from the Sneyd file (from the Big Boileau C
2 CONC hart).
