1 NOTE From BBB:
2 CONT b prob at Gorey, Co Wexford, 9 Apr 1841.  Apprentice to Meath Hospital
2 CONC  1858.  Entered Trinity College, Dublin 2 Feb 1859.  BA 1863, MB 1864.
2 CONC   Army Medical Service, Asst Surgeon, 30 Sep 1864 attd to 29th Foot wi
2 CONC th which he served for 12 years in Malta, Canada, Jamaica, Barbados, I
2 CONC reland and Jersey.  Promoted Surgeon Mar 1873, and Surgeon Major Sep 1
2 CONC 876.  Then to Netley Military Hospital as Asst Prof of Pathology, rema
2 CONC ining there until 1883.  Thereafter in India.  Lt Col 1884 (changed to
2 CONC  Bde Surgeon); Bde Surgeon Lt Col 1889.  Retd 9 April 1896, and reside
2 CONC d at Trowbridge, where he was employed as Medical Officer i/c Troops.
