1 NOTE A whole chapter in Chadwick on this poor Charles, with the unforgettab
2 CONC le line “... he struggled against temptation with repeated earnestness
2 CONC  and total failure.”  Got into debt, got bailed out by Daddy time afte
2 CONC r time, was going to be court-martialled but was saved by being sent t
2 CONC o active service in the Crimea. Where, unfortunately, he was killed. H
2 CONC e was shot in the leg, then in the torso, crawled 200 metres to the ne
2 CONC arest trench, wrote a letter to Caroline saying that henceforth he wou
2 CONC ld be a different man (according the Chadwick “... the last and most s
2 CONC incere and most moving of his many professions of penitence...”), and
2 CONC made it to Malta before he finally succumbed.
