2 CONC coming up in the world? Apparently this poor fellow was the son of Arc
2 CONC hibald, 11th of Duntreath, 1768-1807. (b.1717) 
2 CONT (Created a Baronet of the United Kingdom, 3rd May 1774 ). Well, well.
2 CONC He seems to have gone to India as a young man, being raised to a high
2 CONC administrative position.
2 CONT
2 CONT I recommend visiting http://www.edmonstone.com for a history of the Ed
2 CONC monstone family.
2 CONT
2 CONT A detailed biography of this Neil Benjamin is given in the Oxford Dict
2 CONC ionary of National Biography.
