1 NOTE From an anonymous web page:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Abraham Francis HAWKINS was christened 6 Feb 1804 in Denapore, Be
2 CONC ngal, India. He was a Judge in the Supreme Court of Calcutta after bei
2 CONC ng a magistrate in (I believe) Baraset. He was a founding member of th
2 CONC e Bengal Athletic Club. He married Jan 25 1836 in Calcutta, with Marga
2 CONC ret Edmonstone MCLEOD, daughter of Duncan MCLEOD and Henrietta FRIELL.
2 CONC  He died May 1 1879 in England where he had retired.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had a son Robert McLeod HAWKINS who was also born in India, 1839, a
2 CONC nd eventually became a minister when his plans for life in India did n
2 CONC ot work out. He married Agnes Charlotte Augusta MARSHALL in Beckenham,
2 CONC  Kent, England in 1865.
