2 CONC er throughout the siege of 1857.   Educ at Haileybury, 1866-70.  Becam
2 CONC e an indigo planter in Bihar, N India.  He m 1885 Margaret, dau of Col
2 CONC  ... Sherwill, and had issue : Brandram Francis Sherwill, Marguerite A
2 CONC lice Knyvett and Walter Lind Sherwill.
