1 NOTE From BBB:
2 CONT b 1862.  Lt 3rd Militia Ban, Norfolk Regt 1881.  Joined the Indian Pol
2 CONC ice, Bengal Presidency 1884.  Asst Supt at various places in Bengal;
2 CONC Dist Supt 1891;  retd 1900.
2 CONT
2 CONT War of 1914-18 : Remount Service, T/Major.   Master of the Old Berks F
2 CONC oxhounds, for a number of years.      A Press paragraph of about 1939
2 CONC said of him : 'He only gave up hunting a year or two ago;  now he spen
2 CONC ds his time writing foxhunting rhymes and painting little hunting pict
2 CONC ures.    Everybody calls him 'Dog Fox', a nickname he has had for year
2 CONC s'.
2 CONT
2 CONT He m 1891, Ida, dau of Lewis Langworthy of Manchester, and had issue a
2 CONC  dau, Mildred Ida Mary.   d at Bray, 1940.
2 CONT
2 CONT Again from BBB:
2 CONT In 1894, the Marquis de Valfons made out a short pedigree of the Frenc
2 CONC h branch up to that time, for Henry Willock Boileau, who had a transla
2 CONC tion printed.   It has printing errors.  Henry Willock also produced a
2 CONC  chart pedigree in skeleton form which was widely distributed in the f
2 CONC amily, but unfortunately it has errors of fact.
