1 NOTE From BBB:
2 CONT Probably a pensioner at Trinity College, Dublin, 3 Nov 1817;  Cadet, H
2 CONC EICS, 1817.  Lt, Bengal Native Infantry, 1 Jan 1819.  Posted to 1/16 B
2 CONC n, NI;  Interpreter and QM, 27 Nov 1823.   The Bn became 32nd NI, May
2 CONC 1825.  It was taking part in the siege of Bhurtpore when Solomon d at
2 CONC Cawnpore 14 Dec,  1825, but the cause of his death is not known.   Unm
2 CONC arried.
