1 NOTE From BBB:
2 CONT b 22 Oct 1869.  Educ Marlborough College, 1882-84.   Became an indigo
2 CONC planter at Mozufferpore, Bihar, India.  South African War : Joined Lum
2 CONC sden's Horse, an irregular corps raised in India among British residen
2 CONC ts, and landed in South Africa Mar 1900.  Being ill with pneumonia, he
2 CONC  was left in Capetown when the regt went up-country;  it is not clear
2 CONC when he rejoined, but it was actively engaged until Nov 1900 and he wa
2 CONC s then present.    The regt shortly afterwards returned to India, but
2 CONC Knyvett and others stayed behind and he joined the Johannesburg Police
2 CONC .   He was later drowned in Florida 18 Oct 1906.
