1 NOTE From the Dictionary of National Biography:
2 CONT
2 CONT McLeod, Sir Donald Friell (1810–1872), administrator in India, was bor
2 CONC n at Fort William, Calcutta, on 6 May 1810, the second son of Lieutena
2 CONC nt-General Duncan McLeod (1780–1856) and his wife, Henrietta Caroline
2 CONC Lestock, née Friell (1781/2–1830), who was descended on her mother's s
2 CONC ide from a Huguenot family, the Boileaus of Castelnau.
2 CONT
2 CONT It goes on with an extensive entry.
