1 NOTE Pemberton - Lieutenant Duncan Scott - Royal Artillery - died 23rd Augu
2 CONC st 1888. Son of Captain Robert Boileau Pemberton (44th Bengal N.I.). B
2 CONC orn in Calcutta, 25th February 1837. Served Mutiny 1857 (medal and bar
2 CONC ). Married Lilley Sandys at Simla, 5th September 1877. (his second mar
2 CONC riage). Grave at Srinagar - "In loving memory of Colonel Duncan Scott
2 CONC Pemberton, Royal Artillery, died 23.8.1888."
2 CONT  Tablet in St. Mary Magdalene's Church, Lahore - "Sacred to the loved
2 CONC memory of Colonel Duncan Scott Pemberton Royal Artillery who died at G
2 CONC ulmarg, Kashmir, on the 23rd August 1888, aged 51. and of Lieut. Colon
2 CONC el Sholto Edmonstone Pemberton Royal Artillery who died at Mian Mir on
2 CONC  the 25th Sept. 1889 aged 49."
