1 NOTE I visited Joyce in December, 2008; she was then living in Christchurch
2 CONC , in Althorp Place. A charming lady, she showed me all her records of
2 CONC the McPherson family, and a letter which her uncle, Benjamin, had writ
2 CONC ten to her father, Adam. I’ve got a lot of information from Joyce, so
2 CONC a big thank you to her. In payment I fixed her range hood! Hooray. Let
2 CONC ’s hope it stays fixed.
