2 CONC n Edinburgh. Married Maria Denoon Young, an authoress, in 1845 in Edin
2 CONC burgh. Their first 2 children, a son and daughter, were born in Stirli
2 CONC ng where he was also a writer. He had another 5 daughters born in Edin
2 CONC burgh where he moved to live. He acquired an ironworks and ceased to p
2 CONC ractise law. How he acquired the business I do not know but being a la
2 CONC wyer he may have been involved if there was a bankruptcy and managed t
2 CONC o acquire it. Not unknown in these days.
