1 NOTE With the entry of the Boileaus into the family tree, a huge amount of
2 CONC information becomes available. The Boileaus (once you go back a few ge
2 CONC nerations) were a Huguenot family, nobility from the south of France,
2 CONC intermarrying with other French noble families. Ellen’s pedigree can b
2 CONC e traced in great detail in the pages of the sources shown here. Howev
2 CONC er, her connection to the Boileau de Castelnau relies entirely on two
2 CONC family documents: [RBB], copied by her granddaughter, Catherine Charit
2 CONC y Graham Sneyd; and [BBB], which I obtained from another Boileau desce
2 CONC ndant, Vincent O’Grady. I have so far found that these family document
2 CONC s are consistent with each other, and agree in most respects with Lart
2 CONC  and Chesnaye-Desbois, so I believe them to be accurate.
