1 NOTE In 'Barton Family Tree' from Robert Barton's biography of John Barton
2 CONC of Chicester, her year of birth is given as 1831. (And it mentions 6 c
2 CONC hildren).
2 CONT
2 CONT BUT in Malcolm's "Descendants of Josias Dupre" doc and in his "Descend
2 CONC ants of Samuel Smith" doc., it says "she was born 1844 in East Leigh,
2 CONC Havant, Southampton, and died Abt. 1876" and lists only 5 children. Th
2 CONC e latter seem more detailed, but there are many sources attesting that
2 CONC  Fanny Rickman died in 1842, so her daughter can't have been born two
2 CONC years later!
2 CONT
2 CONT Malcolm (in letter dated Sep 2, 2009) believes the correct year is 184
2 CONC 1, based on family tree in Robert Barton's book, appendix vi, though I
2 CONC 've yet to see that book myself.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also mentioned in Emily's Memoir p81
2 CONT
2 CONT In Emily's Memoir, Appendices: The John Barton Family
2 CONT
2 CONT In Rev. John Barton's Family Tree book, p1, 10, 22.
2 CONT p10,22 give d.o.b. 25 Sep 1841
2 CONT p10 gives death as "Dec 1878"
2 CONT p22 gives death as "Nov 1878"!
2 CONT
