1 NOTE We have a (very hard to read) inventory of his property. Signatories o
2 CONC n this include Christopher Robinson (another Chapel signatory?), Thoma
2 CONC s Baits (?) and two John Bartons. It looks like Christopher Robinson w
2 CONC rote the whole thing since his signature (which looks the same as on t
2 CONC he 1682 chapel document) matches the handwriting; Baits signs with a B
2 CONC ; Both Johns seem to sign their own names- the second one very badly!
2 CONC The first John’s signature has some strong similarities to the signatu
2 CONC re on the 1682 chapel document, though the B in the Barton is rather d
2 CONC ifferent in each case.
