2 CONT
2 CONT Email from Gill Speechley dated Nov 19 2009:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Ernst von Hoff was Ron's father. Ron was illegitimate. My my newly fo
2 CONC und cousins tell me he was known as Ron Hoff as a child then changed h
2 CONC is name to Budd in adulthood and indeed grew up believing his mother (
2 CONC Dorothy Louise) was his sister and his grandmother (Caroline) was his
2 CONC Mother. I understand Ernst von Hoff was a German living in England dur
2 CONC ing the war and after Ron's conception/birth he was interned and died
2 CONC on the Isle of Man. I am not sure where to go to find out anything abo
2 CONC ut his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernest Wilmott Budd lived with (and married?) Caroline (Ron's maternal
2 CONC  grandmother who together with Mr Budd brought him up) although I can
2 CONC find no record of a marriage. The only thing I am going on is that on
2 CONC Caroline's death certificate it states she was the wife of Ernest Wilm
2 CONC ott Budd, however, perhaps if they had lived together as man and wife
2 CONC for years he might still have told the authorities they were married t
2 CONC o keep up appearances. I doubt they would have asked for proof.
2 CONT
2 CONT Caroline married (in 1894) my great grandfather Samuel Shuttleworth (D
2 CONC orothy's father) and he appears with them in the 1911 Census then 'dis
2 CONC appears'! I can find no further record of him."
