2 CONC n Ilford where he used to dive and Jimmy went along and they wouldn't
2 CONC let him in because they thought he was Reg until he could prove otherw
2 CONC ise. They said to him you must have a twin and he said he knew he did
2 CONC but he'd never met him. Someone fetched Reg and from that moment they
2 CONC were inseparable.
2 CONT They both dived and were known as The Heavenly Twins (as well as Buddy
2 CONC  and Crabby) and went on to compete in several English springboarding
2 CONC championships.
2 CONT Reg lived at 7 Cranbrook Road above the bank.
