1 TITL {http://chateau-mostuejouls.com.  This is a very nice web site, that g
2 CONC ives references for its facts, and pictures of old charters and deeds.
2 CONC  It seems well researched and reliable. It’s about the history of the
2 CONC family and village of Mostuejouls. The major source they quote is
2 CONT "MOSTUEJOULS - Une famille Un village - 1000 ans d'histoire", Henri de
2 CONC  Barrau, Henri Dupont, Auguste Galdemar,
2 CONT which I have never read, unfortunately. They also quote a number of ot
2 CONC her documents, including Louis de La Roque. It’s difficult for me to k
2 CONC now how accurate it is for the first few generations (which is all I u
2 CONC se here), but it’s consistent with everything else I have seen.}
